<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Thank You - Carols 2025</title>
    <style>
        :root { --gold: #d4af37; --xmas-red: #d42426; --xmas-green: #004d26; }
        
        body { 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; 
            background: var(--xmas-green); 
            background-image: url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/snow.png');
            color: white; margin: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; 
            min-height: 100vh; text-align: center;
        }

        .card { 
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98); color: #333; padding: 40px 20px; border-radius: 25px; 
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); border: 5px solid var(--gold); 
            max-width: 600px; width: 90%; position: relative;
        }

        h1 { color: var(--xmas-red); font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { line-height: 1.6; color: #444; font-size: 18px; }

        .highlight-box {
            background: #f9f9f9; border: 1px dashed var(--gold);
            padding: 20px; border-radius: 15px; margin: 25px 0;
        }

        .btn-support { 
            display: inline-block; background: var(--xmas-red); color: white; 
            padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; transition: 0.3s;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(212, 36, 38, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-support:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); background: #a01a1c; }

        .footer-note { font-size: 14px; color: #888; margin-top: 30px; }
        
        .stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</div>
        <h1>Thank You for Joining Us!</h1>
        <p style="font-weight: bold; color: var(--xmas-green);">Sounds of Hope Choir - Carols 2025</p>
        
        <p>Our hearts are full. Thank you for spending your evening at Martyrs Church Nateete and celebrating the birth of Christ with us.</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <h3 style="color: var(--xmas-green); margin-top: 0;">📸 Event Highlights</h3>
            <p style="font-size: 15px;">Photos and videos from tonight will be uploaded to our social media pages soon!</p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/256754935098?text=Please%20send%20me%20the%20link%20to%20tonight's%20photos!" style="color: var(--xmas-red); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none;">Request Photo Link via WhatsApp →</a>
        </div>

        <p>Would you like to support the <b>Mackay Youth Ministry</b> as we continue to spread hope through music?</p>
        
        <a href="https://wa.me/256754935098?text=I%20would%20like%20to%20support%20the%20Choir/Ministry" class="btn-support">💖 Support Our Ministry</a>

        <div class="footer-note">
            <p style="margin:0;">"The light shines in the darkness..." - John 1:5</p>
            <p style="margin-top:10px;">Merry Christmas & Happy New Year 2026!</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
